On Linux (glibc, x86_64/aarch64), Apple-silicon macOS and Windows (MSVC), a
build of this crate links ONNX Runtime statically into the final binary: the
`ort` crate's build script downloads a prebuilt ONNX Runtime 1.31.0 archive
from cdn.pyke.io. On every other target the application loads an ONNX Runtime
shared library at run time. Either way, an application that ships this crate
ships ONNX Runtime and must carry the notice below, together with the notices
of the third-party components ONNX Runtime itself contains, which upstream
lists in ThirdPartyNotices.txt:
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/blob/v1.31.0/ThirdPartyNotices.txt

